  (:id "elixir/R9" :type :task :title "a known hash with a different layout length or bytes → layout_malformed; the seven §1.1 malformations under a known hash all come back as this one name" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/elixirtable/fixedroadmap_t01_test.go: TestFixedRoadmapT01Framing/elixir/R9" "docs/roadmap-evidence/fixed-elixir.sexp at d025f769c789 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5 (sprint stream schema-fixed-elixir)") :audit-item "R9" :reported-state "implemented-asserted" :reported-source "https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/schema/issues/898#issuecomment-5648012854" :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at a782615e2906, landed on sprint/schema-finish at d025f769c789 (card fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: Historical report at b7ab66a8; current completion has not been reconciled." :tested-revision "a782615e2906e6ea842a7d25eb36b78a1a790eb5" :landed-revision "d025f769c789d1df58f4fd11b1cdc363640191c0")
  (:id "elixir/R12" :type :task :title "the per-record hash check is before the prefill: no_layout writes nothing" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/elixirtable/fixedroadmap_t01_test.go: TestFixedRoadmapT01Framing/elixir/R12" "docs/roadmap-evidence/fixed-elixir.sexp at d025f769c789 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5 (sprint stream schema-fixed-elixir)") :audit-item "R12" :reported-state "owed" :reported-source "https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/schema/issues/898#issuecomment-5648012854" :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at a782615e2906, landed on sprint/schema-finish at d025f769c789 (card fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: NOT reconciled, under Glenn ruling of 2026-09-19: done means everything is tested and verified working; not done until tested. This task title has TWO clauses and only one is tested on this leg. The second, no_layout writes nothing, is carried by #1169 in :evidence: the refusal returns the reason atom and no value, while a control read of the SAME record unforged through the SAME reader returns {:ok, values, report} with exactly one value, so the refusal withholds a value this reader demonstrably builds. The FIRST clause — the per-record hash check is BEFORE the prefill — has NO test on this leg and may not be observable on the BEAM at all: there is no caller-owned destination, so a reader that built the value and discarded it is indistinguishable from one that never built it. The six legs that poison 0x5A and sweep every byte prove the ordering because an untouched poison rules out a prefill that ran; this leg has no such surface. Was :done with the residual named; the ruling says a named residual on a clause of the title is not done. What would close it: any observation on this leg that distinguishes a prefill that ran from one that did not." :tested-revision "a782615e2906e6ea842a7d25eb36b78a1a790eb5" :landed-revision "d025f769c789d1df58f4fd11b1cdc363640191c0")
  (:id "elixir/R13" :type :task :title "REFUSE is total: refused+reason and malformed are never both set, every counter stays zero, and not one destination byte is written" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/elixirtable/fixedroadmap_t01_test.go: TestFixedRoadmapT01Framing/elixir/R13" "docs/roadmap-evidence/fixed-elixir.sexp at d025f769c789 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5 (sprint stream schema-fixed-elixir)") :audit-item "R13" :reported-state "implemented-asserted" :reported-source "https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/schema/issues/898#issuecomment-5648012854" :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at a782615e2906, landed on sprint/schema-finish at d025f769c789 (card fixed-elixir-t01-framing-5). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: Historical report at b7ab66a8; current completion has not been reconciled." :tested-revision "a782615e2906e6ea842a7d25eb36b78a1a790eb5" :landed-revision "d025f769c789d1df58f4fd11b1cdc363640191c0")
