  (:id "shared/S1" :type :task :title "BASELINE(old, new): the monotone law at commit, per row, on evaluated values; every FAIL names the table, the definition, the rule and both values; the compiler refuses to generate against a lock the schema contradicts" :state :done :evidence ("compiler/sharedroadmap_lock_test.go: TestSharedRoadmapLock/shared/S1" "internal/baseline/baseline_test.go: TestRefusals" "docs/roadmap-evidence/shared.sexp at 2405ef916f64 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land schema-go-shared-lockc (sprint stream schema-go)") :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at e323e5c2c367, landed on sprint/schema-finish at 2405ef916f64 (card schema-go-shared-lockc). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: Shared gate, counted once outside language percentages. S3 changed-reason retirement remains partial; no inherited whole-gate completion." :tested-revision "e323e5c2c367e85b604a16536475b24922ac7c16" :landed-revision "2405ef916f64a0a94634c45432deff9d22691055")
  (:id "shared/S2" :type :task :title "the lock holds the lineage (wire hash, layout bytes verbatim, digest, record body, retired mark, reason); the line is one statement made twice (the parse recomputes the wire hash and refuses a disagreement); the set is bound by lineage=0x… so a deleted or reordered line refuses by name" :state :done :evidence ("compiler/sharedroadmap_lock_test.go: TestSharedRoadmapLock/shared/S2" "internal/lockfile/lineage_test.go: TestLockLineageFirstEntryIsTheFirstLayout" "internal/lockfile/lineage_test.go: TestLockLineageRecordsTheDefinitionsDigest" "internal/lockfile/lineage_test.go: TestLockRetireEntry" "internal/lockfile/lineage_test.go: TestLockLineageHandEditRefused" "internal/lockfile/lineage_test.go: TestLineageSetIsBoundByTheRollup" "docs/roadmap-evidence/shared.sexp at 2405ef916f64 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land schema-go-shared-lockc (sprint stream schema-go)") :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at e323e5c2c367, landed on sprint/schema-finish at 2405ef916f64 (card schema-go-shared-lockc). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: Shared gate, counted once outside language percentages. S3 changed-reason retirement remains partial; no inherited whole-gate completion." :tested-revision "e323e5c2c367e85b604a16536475b24922ac7c16" :landed-revision "2405ef916f64a0a94634c45432deff9d22691055")
  (:id "shared/S3" :type :task :title "the floor is the operator's: schema lock --floor T=N / --retire T@0x<hash> --reason \"…\", and a second retire of the same hash is idempotent (a card says it is not today)" :state :unknown :evidence nil :note "Open, v1.3 (2026-10-11): card schema-go-shared-lockc landed on sprint/schema-finish at 2405ef916f64 with this task unknown: the --floor T=N clause is an open question the page never settles (docs/FIXED-FORM-BILL-READS-BACKWARD.md (on sprint/schema-finish) §9 The floor's syntax is Glenn's to name; §6b; docs/FIXED-FORM-ALGORITHM.md (on sprint/schema-finish) §5.2 defines the floor as derived: one past the highest Retired index, 0 when none), so it is not decided here; the --retire/--reason and idempotent second-retire halves are proved by internal/lockfile.TestLockRetireEntry and cmd/schema.TestSharedS3Gate (a second retire of the same hash is idempotent) Earlier note: Shared gate, counted once outside language percentages. S3 changed-reason retirement remains partial; no inherited whole-gate completion." :sprint-card "schema-go-shared-lockc" :release "v1.3")
  (:id "shared/S4" :type :task :title "COMPILE reads lockfile.Lineage / lockfile.Floor, not the filename convention, and not a hard-coded floor" :state :done :evidence ("compiler/sharedroadmap_lock_test.go: TestSharedRoadmapLock/shared/S4" "compiler/shared_s4_gate_test.go: TestSharedS4Gate" "docs/roadmap-evidence/shared.sexp at 2405ef916f64 on sprint/schema-finish: this task's done form, landed by land schema-go-shared-lockc (sprint stream schema-go)") :note "Done 2026-10-11 from its landed evidence form: tested at e323e5c2c367, landed on sprint/schema-finish at 2405ef916f64 (card schema-go-shared-lockc). The code and the test are on sprint/schema-finish; main carries them once that branch merges. Earlier note: Shared gate, counted once outside language percentages. S3 changed-reason retirement remains partial; no inherited whole-gate completion." :tested-revision "e323e5c2c367e85b604a16536475b24922ac7c16" :landed-revision "2405ef916f64a0a94634c45432deff9d22691055")
